       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TREQ.
       AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN(MAINTAINER).

      *     THIS PROGRAM DOES THE INITIAL CREATE OF AUTO REQUISITIONS
      *     USING THE MREQFILE DATA SET AS
      *     THE INPUT AND GENERATES A REPORT AS OUTPUT USED BY
      *     MATERIALS CONTROL AND ALSO UPDATES THE DATA BASE WITH
      *     THE REQUISITIONS CREATED.
      *
      *     PROCESS OUTLINE
      *      1. READ MREQFILE AND DELETE EACH ENTRY AS THEY
      *         ARE BEING WRITTEN TO REQFILE2
      *      2. READ REQFILE2
      *         -IF RAW MAT. CODE WRITE TO RAW MATERIAL TEMP FILE
      *          FOR PROCESSING LATER
      *         -IF RETURN-SW = "R" WRITE CODE TO REORDER TEMP FILE
      *         -IF RETURN-SW = "E" WRITE CODE TO EXPEDITE TEMP FILE
      *         -OTHER WISE PROCESS CODE AND CREATE REQ. & REPORT
      *      3. READ RAW MATERIAL TEMP FILE
      *         -IF RETURN-SW = "R" WRITE CODE TO REORDER TEMP FILE
      *         -IF RETURN-SW = "E" WRITE CODE TO EXPEDITE TEMP FILE
      *         -OTHER WISE PROCESS CODE AND CREATE REQ. & REPORT
      *      4. UPDATE MPLTINFO PLTINFO-KEY = "PREQ" WITH LAST
      *         REQ. NUMBER ASSIGNED.
      *      5. UPDATE REQDATE FILE WITH THE REQ. NUMBER SEQUENCE FOR
      *         ENG. CODES AND RAW MATERIAL CODES.
      *      6. USING REORDER TEMP FILE CREATE THE CODE ABOVE REORDER
      *         REPORT PORTION
      *      7. USING EXPEDITE TEMP FILE CREATE THE CODES BELOW
      *         EXPEDITE REPORT PORTION.
      *      8. USING THE STOCK OUT TEMP FILE CREATE THE CODES
      *         REDUCED TO A STOCK OUT CONDITION REPORT.
      *C
      *C    AUG 23, 1994  JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 94-001/SLS REQ 6487
      *C    ADDED THE ABILITY ON CORPORATE CODES FLAGGED WITH THE
      *C    AUTHORIZATION FLAG TO USE THE STOREROOM DEFAULT DEPARTMENT
      *C    INSTEAD OF THE SYSTEM DEPARTMENT TO DEFAULT TO.
      *C
      *C     JULY 1996  J E COFFMAN   REQ# 96-018
      *C     ADDED THE ABILITY TO RETAIN THE MMIS REQUISITION NUMBER
      *C     FOR CODED ITEMS THAT GET CHANGED TO THE 6-DIGIT NUMERIC
      *C     STORES REQUISITION NUMBER.
      *C
      *C     SEPTEMBER 1996  J E COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C
      *C     NOVEMBER 17, 1997
      *C     FOR DES MOINES SET SUBD ON REQ TO STOREROOM DEFAULT
      *C     DEPARTMENT.
      *C
      *C     10/5/99    J E COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED CODE FOR NAPANEE ONLY TO PROHIBIT REQS FROM BEING
      *C     GENERATED FOR CORPORATELY-CODED ITEMS BASED ON A FORMULA
      *C     NAPANEE WANTED APPLIED FOR THEIR PLANT. IF THIS IS ADOPTED
      *C     ELSEWHERE, WE MIGHT WANT TO CONSIDER SETTING A SWITCH UP
      *C     UNDER THE REQUISITION USER OPTIONS SO THAT THE PLANTS MAY
      *C     TURN IT OFF OR ON AS THEY WISH.
      *C
      *C     OCT 1999   J E COFFMAN
      *C     IMPLEMENTED CODE FOR MEDICINE HAT AT JIM THOMAS' REQUEST
      *C     TO AUTOMATICALLY QUEUE CORPORATE CODED REQUISITIONS THAT
      *C     HAVE THE STR-AUTH-FLAG SET VIA MP1. THIS IS TO BE DONE
      *C     BECAUSE MEDICINE HAT WILL NOT HAVE A MATERIALS CONTROL
      *C     CLERK WHO WILL USE MA2 TO TOGGLE THE SWITCH WHEN THE REQS
      *C     WOULD NORMALLY BE GETTING RELEASED. THUS ALL REQS THAT
      *C     WOULD NORMALLY BE RELEASED BY MATCONT, GET SENT TO AN
      *C     APPROVAL PATH BEFORE RELEASE TO PURCHASING.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.

       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT REQ-REPORT ASSIGN TO DISK-REQRPTFL.
           SELECT REQ-FILE2 ASSIGN TO DISK-RQ2FILE.
           SELECT RAWMAT-TEMP ASSIGN TO DISK-RAWMAT.
           SELECT REORDER-TEMP ASSIGN TO DISK-REORDER.
           SELECT EXPEDITE-TEMP ASSIGN TO DISK-EXPEDITE.
           SELECT STOCKOUT-TEMP ASSIGN TO DISK-STOCKOUT.
           SELECT REQ-DATE-SEQ-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-REQDATE.
           SELECT SORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MREQ-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2001
