118900*  BLOWUP ROUTINE EXECUTES WHENEVER A       *
119000*  FATAL ERROR OCCURS                       *
119100*                                           *
119200*********************************************
119300
119400 2-BLOWUP.
119500     MOVE "TREQ"                  TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
119600     MOVE CODE-ARG                TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
119700     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
119800         VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
119900             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
120000
120100 2-BLOWUP-X.
120200     EXIT.
120500
120600
120700
