121000*  M A I N                *
121100*                         *
121200***************************
121300
121400 6-MAIN.
121500     PERFORM 60-READ-MREQFILE  THRU  60-RM-X.
121600
121700     SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-CODE
121800         USING REQ-FILE2
121900         GIVING REQ-FILE2.
122000
122100     OPEN INPUT REQ-FILE2.
122200     PERFORM 60-READ-REQ-FILE  THRU  60-RRF-X.
122300     CLOSE  RAWMAT-TEMP.
122400
122500     OPEN INPUT RAWMAT-TEMP.
