156800*                                                *
156900*   COMPUTE DATE WANTED USING STR-EST-LT         *
157000*                                                *
157100**************************************************
157200
157300 62-COMPUTE-DATE-WANTED.
157400     IF DONT-CALC-DATE-WANTED
157500         GO TO 62-PUT-MREQ.
157600     IF STR-EST-LT  =  ZEROS
157700         PERFORM 621-CALC-LAST-DLV-AVG  THRU  621-CLDA-X
           ELSE
      **************************************************
      *    ADDED THE FOLLOWING CHECK FOR LAST DELIVERY *
      *    TIME BEING GREATER THAN ZERO WHEN NAPANEE   *
      *    DISCOVERED THAT THE LEAD TIME FOR A CODE    *
      *    REFLECTED THE SHIP TIME NUMBER THAT HE HAD  *
      *    LOADED INTO THE CORPORATE CODE WHEN THEY    *
      *    MASS LOADED A NUMBER INTO THE DATASET TO    *
      *    ALLOW THE SHIP DATES AND EXPECT DATES TO    *
      *    REFLECT THE SHIP TIME. EVENTUALLY AS THE    *
      *    ITEMS ARE RECEIVED OVER TIME, THE LEAD TIME *
      *    FIELD WILL BE UPDATED WITH MORE REPRESENTAT-*
      *    IVE NUMBERS.....JIM C. 04/24/96             *
      **************************************************
           IF STR-LAST-DLVTIMES (1) > 0
               PERFORM 621-CALC-LAST-DLV-AVG  THRU  621-CLDA-X
157800     ELSE
157900         MOVE STR-EST-LT          TO  LEAD-TIME.
158000     IF LEAD-TIME = ZEROS
158100         GO TO 62-PUT-MREQ.

040600**************************************************
040700*                                                *
040800*   COMPUTE TODAYS JULIAN DATE TO BE USED        *
040900*   WHEN COMPUTING DATE WANTED                   *
041000*                                                *
041100**************************************************
041200
           MOVE YY OF CUR-DATE  TO GREG-YY.
           MOVE MM OF CUR-DATE  TO GREG-MM.
           MOVE DD OF CUR-DATE  TO GREG-DD.
           MOVE SPACES          TO JULIAN-DATE.
           IF GREG-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"        TO GREG-CC
           ELSE
           MOVE "20"            TO GREG-CC.
           CALL "JULGREG" USING GREG-DATE, JULIAN-DATE,
                            DAY-DIGIT, LEAP-YEAR-FLAG.
           MOVE JULIAN-DATE-DDD TO TODAYS-JULIAN.
