095100         ADD 1 TO JULIAN-DATE-YY
               IF JULIAN-DATE-YY = 0
                   MOVE 20      TO  JULIAN-DATE-CC
               END-IF
095200         GO TO 62-CONT-COMPUTE-DATE-WANTED.
