207600         MOVE BUILD-REQ-NO   TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
207700         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
207800
207900     GO TO 621-GET-DREQDESC.
208000
208100 621-FIND-DREQQUE.
           MOVE REQ-ARG TO REQNO OF DREQQUE-REC-O.
           START DREQQUE-O KEY = REQNO OF DREQQUE-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   GO TO 621-GET-MREQ
               ELSE
208500             MOVE "FIND DREQQUE 621-FD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
208600             MOVE REQ-ARG             TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
208700             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
209200
209300 621-GET-DREQQUE.
           READ DREQQUE-O NEXT INTO BUF-DREQQUE
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
