               ELSE
209900             MOVE "GET DREQQUE 621-GD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
210000             MOVE REQ-ARG            TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
210100             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           IF REQNO OF DREQQUE-REC-O NOT = REQ-ARG
               GO TO 621-GET-MREQ.
210400
           DELETE DREQQUE-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
210800         MOVE "DELETE DREQQUE 621-GD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
210900         MOVE REQ-ARG               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
211000         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
211100
211200 621-PUT-DREQQUE.
           IF COMPANY-SAVE = "637"
