               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
211700         MOVE "PUT DREQQUE 621-PD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
211800         MOVE BUILD-REQ-NO   TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
211900         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
212000
212100     GO TO 621-GET-DREQQUE.
212200
212300 621-GET-MREQ.
           MOVE REQ-ARG TO REQNO OF MREQ-REC-O.
           READ MREQ-O INTO BUF-MREQ
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
212700         MOVE "GET MREQ 621-GM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
212800         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
212900
           DELETE MREQ-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
213300         MOVE "DELETE MREQ 621-GM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
213400         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
214300
214400 621-DNM-X.
214500     EXIT.
