221600     MOVE ZEROS                TO  PRT-CTL.
221700     WRITE PRINT-RCD.
221800     MOVE PRINT-HDR2           TO  PRINT-LINE.
221900     MOVE 1                    TO  PRT-CTL.
222000     WRITE PRINT-RCD.
222100     MOVE PRINT-HDR3           TO  PRINT-LINE.
222200     WRITE PRINT-RCD.
